<title>RUSSIA: Kuzbassenergo 1996 pre-tax down to 416 mln rbls.</title>
<headline>Kuzbassenergo 1996 pre-tax down to 416 mln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996</p>
<p>		  (figures in million roubles unless specified)</p>
<p>					1996		    1995</p>
<p>    Sales			   5,676.62		4,358.59</p>
<p>    Costs			   5,254.29		3,421.70</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  416.60		  888.60</p>
<p>    Undistributed profit	    9.67		  170.58</p>
<p>    Accounts payable	    3,346.63		1,645.42</p>
<p>Dividends</p>
<p>    ordinary				 0		   41.2 rbls</p>
<p>    Electricity output	  26,406 million K/h     24,482 million K/h</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name AO Kuzbassenergo. Figures calculated on Russian accruals-based accounting standards. The face value of an ordinary share is 1,000 roubles.</p>
<p>Kuzbassenergo's biggest shareholder is Russia's national power grid UES with 49 percent of the shares. Employees have 18 percent.</p>
<p>The company's capacity is 4.72 megaWatts. It uses 4.54 megaWatts of the capacity.</p>
<p>$=5,761</p>
<p>--Olga Popova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
